Get to Know Zoom Chat

Wednesday, April 21st

 8am JST | 9am AEST

https://click.e.zoom.us/?qs=952790fc2b33f156dabb4a86c65a6e5267b00d2fac6ca2adcfd28d3a01929fc1e6b551a988acb4cb0bd9ef67b4ac4b80627fccdef7667c77c467591d0deed5de 
Get On the Guest List 

Every Zoom customer has access to feature-rich business messaging through the Zoom desktop and mobile app! Zoom Chat can be used for instant collaboration, file sharing, group messaging, and much more.



In this webinar, your Zoom host will walk through the key Zoom Chat features and tips for successful team collaboration. We will cover:

	- A feature overview
	- Best practice to organize your chats and channels
	- Live Q&A
Get an inside look at what Zoom Chat can offer you and your organization and start collaborating effectively!




